{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的大块直接交代人物当下的处境、原因和心理转折，单看大字也能顺着故事走；Y 有些高亮词需要依赖小字才能补全意思。small：Y 的小字与高亮内容结合得更紧，能补充语境和细节；X 的部分感受比喻较绕，与对应话意的联系不够明确。core：Y 更明确地把亲密带来的幸福、时间流逝和害怕失去交织起来，尤其 S07、S13 对核心主题的呈现更突出；concise：X 的叙述更收敛，Y 在 S07、S11 等处有近义意思叠说。human：Y 整体表达更自然，X 有「强控感受」「气味与幻想遗憾层层荡开」「情欲与眷恋生命的热潮」等生硬搭配和抽象堆叠；fine：X 的感受更多落在观众当下的身体感觉和心理体验，Y 有不少内容转去描写声部、旋律和音色，而不是观众的感受。load：Y 的高亮块虽然数量较多，但单块短，扫读负担较轻；X 有些大块较长，在短停留屏幕上不如 Y 容易抓取。综合略选 Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "50e5a8f6-bb01-4df1-b63c-a0125cc65bec", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T222339708732Z", "elapsed_seconds": 230.61, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T22:27:30.323795+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0d870b8ac18e7ffbd92a75b30cc0897b000fcb62175edbf8d1d73274584f5813", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d9